      {"start": 160.832, "end": 161.392, "text": "bird"},
      {"start": 161.392, "end": 162.272, "text": "feces."}
    ]},
    {"start": 162.272, "end": 169.952, "text": "And we were interested in those because humans, ruminants, and birds, those are known environmental fecal shutters of Campylbacter.", "words": [
